    "xtu_rich_content_xWzDGq": {
      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_BmDGmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4>4 Fuse Types. One Flexible Installation Solution.</h4>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_3y47m6": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>The GKU Upgraded Multi-Fuse ACC Hardwire Kit includes eight fuse taps across four commonly used fuse types—Low-Profile Mini, Mini, ATO (Regular) and Micro2—for wider vehicle compatibility. It provides stable USB-C power for 24-hour parking monitoring and is compatible with all GKU dash cams.</strong></p><ul><li>8-Piece Fuse Tap Set</li><li>4 Fuse Types Included</li><li>24H Parking Surveillance</li><li>12V–24V Input</li><li>5V/2.5A USB-C Output</li><li>11.8V ± 0.2V Low-Voltage Protection</li><li>Compatible with All GKU Dash Cams</li></ul>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_8m7aCi": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/XC016banner_363de65a-0232-42e6-a553-5c6da45e7a78.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU hardwire kit for 24-hour parking monitoring, compatible with GKU dash cams",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_mc4zHh": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Professional Installation Recommended:</strong><br/>Installation requires connection to your vehicle’s fuse box. Vehicle electrical systems vary by model, so professional installation is recommended to help ensure safe and correct wiring.</p><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/GKU-V9H_3A.pdf?v=1779175986\"><strong>View the User Manual</strong></a></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_aeWarc": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4>24H Parking Protection, Automatically Activated<br/></h4>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_fzpwBc": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>The GKU ACC Hardwire Kit keeps your compatible dash cam powered after the engine is turned off, allowing parking monitoring to continue while your vehicle is unattended.</p><p>Built-in ACC detection automatically recognizes the vehicle's ignition status:</p><p><strong>Engine On → Driving Recording</strong><br/><strong>Engine Off → Parking Monitoring</strong></p><p><br/>Compatible with 12V–24V vehicle electrical systems, including cars, SUVs, EVs, trucks, vans and buses.<br/><br/></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_wDFY7C": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/b22bf0de-2bd8-4f93-83f6-27f2c3b0556d.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_814c93aa-133e-4654-a2b8-e293249c6fd1.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU hardwire kit for 12V–24V cars, trucks, SUVs, buses and vans with 24-hour parking monitoring",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_CXEUXh": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Depending on your dash cam model, parking monitoring may include:</strong></p><p><strong>G-Sensor Collision Detection</strong><br/>Automatically starts recording when an impact or sudden vibration is detected.</p><p><strong>Time-Lapse Recording</strong><br/>Records continuously at a lower frame rate to capture longer parking periods while reducing storage and power consumption.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_r6hCkM": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/9e9f30e0-1d4c-4441-b748-9569008c78c6.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_2985c75a-7135-4a64-9356-614c2b831be5.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU dash cam parking monitoring with G-sensor collision detection and time-lapse recording, hardwire kit required",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_86HTwD": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4>Stable Power with Built-In Battery Protection<br/></h4>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_k9EW86": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>Designed for compatible <strong>USB-C dash cams</strong>, the GKU ACC Hardwire Kit delivers stable <strong>5V/2.5A power</strong> for reliable recording and parking monitoring.<br/></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_UrfMCn": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>The GKU ACC Hardwire Kit includes multiple built-in safety protections to help provide stable power while reducing the risk of excessive battery drain.</p><ul><li>Low-Voltage Protection<br/></li><li>Over-Current Protection<br/></li><li>Short-Circuit Protection<br/></li><li>Overheat Protection<br/></li></ul><p>The hardwire kit includes low-voltage protection and automatically cuts power when battery voltage falls below approximately 11.8V ± 0.2V. Overheating, overcurrent and short-circuit protection provide additional safety during continuous parking monitoring.<br/><br/></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_EaEhcf": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/97006e2d-3d90-4cac-a561-d6fc014699ed.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_641b63d5-194e-4ea8-aace-8b46ae985ae4.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU hardwire kit with low-voltage battery protection and automatic power cut-off during parking monitoring",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_4CxC6y": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> This kit is not compatible with Mini USB or Micro USB dash cameras and is not recommended for vehicle electrical systems above 24V.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_ecM6KU": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4>Clean and Permanent Installation</h4>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_YBdcYa": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h5>Benefits</h5><ul><li>Reduces visible cable clutter<br/></li><li>Keeps the cigarette lighter port available<br/></li><li>Creates a cleaner, factory-style appearance<br/></li><li>Provides a permanent power connection<br/></li><li>11.5 ft / 3.5 m cable for flexible routing<br/></li></ul><h5>Wiring Guide</h5><p><strong>Red Wire — ACC</strong><br/>Connect to a fuse that receives power when the ignition is on.</p><p><strong>Yellow Wire — BATT</strong><br/>Connect to a constant-power fuse.</p><p><strong>Black Wire — GND</strong><br/>Connect to a suitable metal grounding point.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_aCbU7N": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/14e8ebef-df09-4be5-a1dc-0e1d5c881a8e.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_0f2e878a-f45b-45b1-9288-4b2b0b6d4f15.jpg",
