    "xtu_faq_kT3Ffi": {
      "type": "xtu-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_37LRTh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is different about the Multi-Fuse ACC Hardwire Kit?",
            "answer": "<p>The Multi-Fuse ACC Hardwire Kit includes <strong>8 fuse taps across 4 commonly used fuse types</strong>, providing wider compatibility with different vehicle fuse boxes.</p><p>The package includes:</p><ul><li>2 × Low-Profile Mini</li><li>2 × Mini</li><li>2 × ATO / Regular</li><li>2 × Micro2</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "item_f6em3x": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does this hardwire kit support 24-hour parking mode?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The hardwire kit provides continuous power from your vehicle’s electrical system, allowing compatible GKU dash cams to use parking monitoring features while the vehicle is turned off.</p><p>Available parking mode functions may vary by dash cam model.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_XHwPXM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I confirm that my dash cam has entered Parking Mode?",
            "answer": "<p>If the hardwire kit is installed correctly and Parking Mode is supported by your dash cam, the <strong>Parking Mode</strong> option should appear in the GKU GO app.</p><p>Make sure Parking Mode is enabled in the app before testing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_77XCPT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My dash cam does not enter Parking Mode. What should I check?",
            "answer": "<p>Please check the following:</p><ul><li>Make sure Parking Mode is enabled in the GKU GO app.</li><li>Connect the <strong>red wire</strong> to an ACC / ignition-switched fuse.</li><li>Connect the <strong>yellow wire</strong> to a constant-power fuse.</li><li>Connect the <strong>black wire</strong> to a clean metal grounding point.</li><li>Make sure the selected fuse adapter matches your vehicle’s fuse box.</li></ul><p>Incorrect wiring may prevent the dash cam from switching properly between driving and parking modes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3jErwb": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why does my dash cam stay on after the engine is turned off?",
            "answer": "<p>The red and yellow wires may be connected incorrectly.</p><p>Make sure:</p><p><strong>Red Wire — ACC</strong><br/>Connect to a fuse that powers on and off with the vehicle ignition.</p><p><strong>Yellow Wire — BATT</strong><br/>Connect to a constant-power fuse.</p><p>If these wires are reversed, the dash cam may not switch correctly between driving and parking modes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_V6G4dQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will the hardwire kit drain my car battery?",
            "answer": "<p>The kit includes <strong>low-voltage protection</strong> to help reduce excessive battery drain.</p><p>When the vehicle battery voltage falls below approximately <strong>11.8V ± 0.2V</strong>, the hardwire kit automatically cuts power.</p><p>It also includes <strong>overheating, overcurrent and short-circuit protection</strong> for additional safety.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_wtaBKG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What fuse types are included?",
            "answer": "<p>The package includes <strong>8 fuse taps across 4 fuse types</strong>:</p><ul><li>2 × Low-Profile Mini</li><li>2 × Mini</li><li>2 × ATO / Regular</li><li>2 × Micro2</li></ul><p>Choose the fuse adapter that matches your vehicle’s fuse box before installation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_zYMq8B": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this hardwire kit compatible with GKU dash cams?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The hardwire kit is compatible with <strong>all GKU dash cams</strong>.</p><p>It uses a <strong>USB-C connector</strong> and provides a <strong>5V/2.5A output</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JUbFak": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What vehicles are compatible with this hardwire kit?",
            "answer": "<p>The kit supports <strong>12V–24V vehicle electrical systems</strong> and is suitable for a wide range of vehicles.</p><p>Always check your vehicle’s fuse type and electrical system before installation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_wUUiiz": {
          "type": "item",
